    {
      "id": "Tone",
      "finding": "Shirt neutral/slightly cool (sample b*around−.9); pants a little warmer (−.1M/+.6F), felt shoes visibly warmer (+2.9…3.9). Small chroma-only cloth cooling is preferable to equalizing lightness."
    },
    {
      "id": "Sharpness",
      "finding": "FI/FM shirt weave is softer than FR. Female pants fine twill and male felt grain are already stronger than shirt detail; unequal material texture is not automatically a flaw."
    },
    {
      "id": "Source",
      "finding": "H-current vs earlier C: core center patch RGB exact in all6, shared-opaque RGB91.7–100% exact. Rollback does not restore more native center detail. Old WebP has different RGB and alpha/version; deltas cannot be attributed just to compression."
    },
    {
      "id": "Preserve",
      "finding": "Keep approved fit/contours/cuffs/collars/pockets, pants A waist and straight lower legs, pair-only waist taper, toe volume, all rear returns and male pair construction. No new confirmed shape blocker found in this baseline."
    }
  ],
